Z||000000||fierodave||10-20-2000||10:44 AM||||<BR>LOL  that's what I call a super clean up,  an econo resto  lol<P>Sorry for bragging  I don't usually (I think lol)  but this one turned out so much better than I expected!  thanks keith for talking me into doing it!<BR>Just wanted to show you that with a limited amount of time & money how nice you can Detail one out that just needed some TLC.<BR>So with 46 hours and about $150.00 in materials I ended up with this!<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=9241258" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=9241258</A> <P>Thanks for looking at "ACE"  that's what I named this car LOL Because of it's A/C delet feature (easy to remeber)<BR>Have a great weekend everyone!<BR>Thanks for the space<BR>FD  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://members.theglobe.com/fierodave/gifs/fierosig.gif"> ||||reg||10
