Z||000006||fierodave||10-20-2000||07:28 PM||||I won't sell this one at least until the end of our nice car season here in Wi!  <P>I have a ton of time in it, and want to enjoy it until the snow stays on the ground and it's time to store it.<P>It's never seen salt,  so it would be a shame to use it in the winter and and mess up the detailing it just received!<P>I Put 50 miles on it today, what a nice car!<P>Have a great weekend ALL!!!!!!<BR>FD<p>[This message has been edited by fierodave (edited 10-20-2000).]||||reg||1
